     =========================================================

     MODES
     ---------------------------------------------------------
     AUTO
       - Breadcrumb "Mock Exams" => Mock Exam
       - Otherwise => Quiz

     QUIZ
       - Random answer if unanswered
       - Wait for Feedback + correct answer
       - Extract immediately

     MOCK EXAM - TAKING
       - Random answer only
       - DO NOT save/extract
       - DO NOT require Feedback
       - Stop at manually entered final question
       - User submits exam manually

     MOCK EXAM - REVIEW
       - Auto detected from Feedback/correct-answer state
       - DO NOT answer
       - Extract question + choices + correct answer + explanation

     SAFETY
     ---------------------------------------------------------
     - Manual Total Questions required
     - Never click Next after final question
     - Duplicate protection
     - Wait for stable React rendering
